  "details": "If verbal users are allowed to use their voice to make noise by default, mutes should be able to do the same. It's still really hard to grab people's attention in certain situations and I'm sure I'm not alone in getting frustrated of having to explain to every new person I meet to turn the sound on.\n\nI understand that this could lead to an uptick in chatbox spam trolling in its current state, but would be a non-issue if implemented alongside the individual chatbox override idea from https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/1222-indivual-user-override-for-chatbox-visibility",
